      "value": "@{5f30421bda52487c3a337b91|full_name}: I wouldn't write this entirely off.\nFirst off there's a strong use case for when buying pre-made avatars from say, booth. It'd obviously be best if these were updated but there's a good chance older models just won't be, at least for a while. In this use case, the parameters are very much present in unity, but the script is not. It'll show up as a missing script but you  may still be able to access it through code.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
