      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i dont think thay will ever include is as that likely would require them to pay dynamic bones devs alot of money since its a paid asset being included in the sdk just for conversion. and i dont think you can convert the missing script component. if thay were willing to include it thay would have years ago. its not hard to get it for free either",
      "viewerReactions": null
